Changes in this fork: board support for the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.85C,
ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.43C and ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.8; spoken replies via
ElevenLabs; pushes; touch volume; ADC battery reading; secrets tooling.

Third-party material:
- The ST77916 vendor init sequence and board pin maps for the 1.85C come from
  Waveshare's examples (https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.85C,
  Apache License 2.0).
- Pin maps, the SH8601 init sequence and touch registers for the 1.43C and the
  1.8 were taken as hardware facts from Waveshare's published examples and
  schematics; no Waveshare source files are included.
- Panel, touch and codec drivers (esp_lcd_st77916, esp_lcd_sh8601,
  esp_lcd_co5300, esp_codec_dev) are fetched at build time from the Espressif
  component registry under their own licenses (Apache License 2.0).
- muse_lcd_bands.c's flush-wait fix is cherry-picked from upstream pull request
  #34 by Todd Sherman.

